'Check balance, send, buy airtime':['Kureba amafaranga asigaye, kohereza, kugura ama-unite','Consulter le solde, envoyer, acheter du crédit'],
'Copy code':['Koporora kode','Copier le code'],
'You both get 500 RWF when they send their first payment.':['Mwembi mubona 500 RWF igihe aboherereje ubwishyu bwa mbere.','Vous recevez tous les deux 500 RWF dès son premier paiement.'],
'Your code':['Kode yawe','Votre code'],
'Friends joined':['Inshuti zinjiye','Amis inscrits'],
