</script>
<script>
/* v494: Places, round two. (1) Map: opening Places > Map showed "Nothing nearby" under pins that were on screen, because the sheet was drawn while the category was still empty; it is now drawn again once the category is All. (2) Places hub, Near you: each place was three lines (name, details, a green open line). Now two: name with a small Eats tag for itunda Eats stores, then rating, type and distance, and the open time moves to the right ("Open till 19:00", red when closed). (3) Place page, Reviews / Photos / Nearby / Info: only the Directions row stays on top; Order, Pay here and Reserve stay on Home, so these tabs start higher. */
