<script>
/* v495: Places and Directions, round three. Places hub, Near you: each place is now two lines (name, then "★ 4.0 · Open till 20:00"); the category word is gone because the icon already says it, so the status no longer wraps onto a third line. Directions hub, Recent routes: places show their distance under the name (the date moves into the same line), so you can tell a 0.2 km walk from a 6 km ride before you tap. */
